MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=0
RELEASE_VERSION=1
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=1
DESCRIPTION=cd: NUL-terminate g_cwd when getcwd fails after chdir. Shell: check pthread mutex/cond init and pthread_create; guard batch command totalLen against size_t overflow. IPC: msgq_create rejects max_messages*message_size overflow; msgq_receive sets errno (EINVAL, EPIPE, EAGAIN, ETIMEDOUT) on host. VFS: safer size_t bounds for legacy disk ruler/allocs, cluster table malloc, format path; fs import ruler/zeros; FAT32 bytes-per-cluster multiply overflow guard; fat32_host_files cluster-chain malloc overflow guard.

RELEASE_DATE=2026-05-18
